# Open Items Tracker — <ENTITY NAME>

**As of:** <YYYY-MM-DD>
**Rule: rows are never deleted.** A resolved row is marked `CLOSED` with the evidence path that
closed it. A row that turns out to be wrong is marked `WITHDRAWN` with the reason. Deleting a row
destroys the audit trail this file exists to keep.

## Status vocabulary

`OPEN` · `BLOCKED` (waiting on a named third party or determination) · `CLOSED` (evidence in hand,
path recorded) · `WITHDRAWN` (the item was wrong or moot; say why)

